.45. 28,540,667 shares were traded during mid-day trading, a decline of 43% from the average session volume of 49,836,957 shares. The stock had previously closed at $390.84.","provider":"exa","query":"Tesla stock price 2026-11-12","fetchedAt":"2026-11-12T08:04:00.000Z"},{"url":"https://tradesmith.com/stockdata/TSLA:NASDAQ/historical-data","title":"TSLA | Tesla | Historical Data | TradeSmith","text":"Tesla (TSLA) \n\nNASDAQ\n\n$399.87+$2.42 (+0.61%) \n\nPrice as of Nov 12, 2026 8:00 PM EST\n\n- $1.5T Market Cap\n- -1.13% 1-Year Change\n- Auto Manufacturers Industry\n\n- 1 Month\n\n+5.14% \n\nLow Price$343.69\n\nHigh Price$407.46\n- 3 Months\n\n+21.36% \n\nLow Price$336.87\n\nHigh Price$407.46\n- 1 Year\n\n-1.13% \n\nLow Price$298.32\n\nHigh Price$489.88\n\n| Date | Open | High | Low | Close | Change (%) | Volume |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 11/12/2026 | 386.36 | 401.22 | 385.20 | 397.45 | +1.69% | 29,123,505 |\n| 11/11/2026 | 386.58 | 395.43 | 386.35 | 390.84 | +2.91% | 27,818,838 |\n| 11/10/2026 | 370.85 | 380.00 | 370.40 | 379.78 | +0.46% | 23,989,383 |\n| 11/09/2026 | 360.25 | 382.20 | 360.02 | 378.05 | +5.54% | 36,338,411 |\n| 11/06/2026 | 348.92 | 363.84 | 347.60 | 358.22 | +4.23% | 36,728,675 |\n| 11/05/2026 | 374.12 | 374.30 | 338.15 | 343.69 | -10.77% | 79,989,048 |\n| 11/04/2026 | 379.80 | 392.04 | 375.50 | 385.19 | -3.34% | 47,835,237 |\n| 11/03/2026 | 406.25 | 406.50 | 396.53 | 398.50 | -1.32% | 26,651,207 |\n| 11/02/2026 | 404.66 | 414.23 | 397.61 | 403.82 | +1.00% | 43,177,671 |\n| 10/30/2026 | 393.22 | 404.22 | 387.52 | 399.81 | -0.87% | 41,736,931 |\n| 10/29/2026 | 405.63 | 406.98 | 400.50 | 403.30 | -0.23% | 22,848,361 |\n| 10/28/2026 | 410.16 | 410.85 | 397.18 | 404.22 | -0.80% | 35,592,618 |\n| 10/27/2026 | 397.76 | 408.45 | 395.25 | 407.46 | +4.04% | 45,333,599 |\n| 10/26/2026 | 383.83 | 397.27 | 383.73 | 391.62 | +5.21% | 54,072,466 |\n| 10/23/2026 | 373.20 | 377.32 | 365.27 | 372.22 | -0.63% | 34,762,784 |\n| 10/22/2026 | 374